
<view class="reading-root intro-root {{elderMode ? 'reading-elder' : ''}} {{readingLarge ? 'reading-large' : ''}}" style="{{readingStyle}}">
<page-navigation title="认识有谱家谱" home page-gutter />
<scroll-view class="intro-scroll" scroll-y show-scrollbar="{{false}}">
<view class="intro-page page-shell">
  <view class="intro-hero surface-card">
    <text class="intro-eyebrow">有谱家谱</text>
    <text class="intro-title">让后辈知道，<text class="intro-title-line">我们的家从哪里来</text></text>
    <text class="intro-copy">把亲人的名字、关系和故事，整理成一份全家共修的家谱。</text>
    <image class="intro-art" src="/images/share/intro-family.svg" mode="aspectFit" aria-hidden="true" />
  </view>

  <view class="intro-section">
    <view class="intro-values surface-card">
      <view class="intro-value"><text class="value-title">家族脉络，看得清</text><text class="value-copy">把长辈、同辈和晚辈连起来，理清亲属关系。</text></view>
      <view class="intro-value"><text class="value-title">长辈故事，记得住</text><text class="value-copy">用生平和照片，留下每位家人的经历。</text></view>
      <view class="intro-value"><text class="value-title">一家人，共同完善</text><text class="value-copy">邀请家人补充资料，让家谱在共修中逐步完整。</text></view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <text class="intro-privacy">家谱默认仅受邀家人可访问。</text>
</view>
</scroll-view>
<view class="intro-dock">
  <view class="intro-actions">
    <button class="primary-button intro-button" bindtap="createFamily">创建我的家谱</button>
    <button class="secondary-button intro-button" bindtap="openExamples">先看示例家谱</button>
  </view>
</view>
</view>
